17592186345198 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129156 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186345199 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129156 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186366288 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129156 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186388667 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129156 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392259 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129156 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393598 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129156 #edb/ref 1039 "Multiplying Complex Matrices" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129156 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186128974 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129156 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "83fad21d-6b36-5198-a13f-362d34342475" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048701 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048896 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129647 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129706 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186266060 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186268912 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186268913 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186345166 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186345168 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186345169 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186345170 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186345171 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1039 "Calculating the Complex Conjugate of a Complex Matrix" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186128975 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129157 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "c7c1b7ad-e4bf-55b2-8665-2cf35e402946" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186129971 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186129972 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186129973 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186130011 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186130012 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1045 "Matrices Over the Complex Numbers" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186129971 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186048275 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129358 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "606b524c-331d-50d0-b61a-4fc9da0cc19e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129971 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186130012 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129971 #edb/ref 1061 20159 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129971 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4c310c92-8b22-50ab-98aa-2611b0502ab8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129971 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186130350 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129972 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186130011 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129972 #edb/ref 1061 20160 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129972 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8f1dc324-508c-5aeb-b5fa-002f72751b63" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129972 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186129132 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129973 #edb/ref 1061 20161 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129973 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5282e2f0-4384-5d40-a566-3bd80bc243b0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129973 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186129133 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130011 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186129973 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130011 #edb/ref 1061 21666 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130011 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ba63f810-d731-59ef-9355-05e269d51c2c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130011 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186129156 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130012 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186129972 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130012 #edb/ref 1061 21667 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130012 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5542ff65-c283-5776-a3e6-a07c95c8db7d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130012 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186129157 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130350 #edb/ref 1064 "It's possible to define matrices with complex entries, such as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1+\\text{i} & 4-\\text{i} \\\\ 3+2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nIn general, $\\mathbb{C}^{m \\times n}$ is the space of complex matrices with dimension $m \\times n.$\n\nComplex matrices work mostly the same as real matrices (we can add them, multiply them, etc). However, complex matrices have a few extra properties:\n\n- We take the complex conjugate of a matrix by taking the complex conjugate of each component:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1+\\text{i} & 4-\\text{i} \\\\ 3+2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Complex matrices also have a real part and an imaginary part. That means we can write any matrix in the form $A={\\color{blue}B}+\\textrm{i}\\,{\\color{red}C},$ where ${\\color{blue}B} = {\\color{blue}\\textrm{Re}(A)}$ and ${\\color{red}C} = {\\color{red}\\textrm{Im}(A)}.$\n\nThe real part of the matrix contains the real part of each entry, and the imaginary part of the matrix contains the imaginary part of each entry:\n \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1+\\text{i} & 4-\\text{i} \\\\ 3+2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130350 #edb/ref 1065 3591 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130350 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "ed2b9640-b192-5de0-b784-2aad4cb89984" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130350 #edb/ref 1067 "Matrices Over the Complex Numbers" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147494 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049741 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147494 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186148222 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147494 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186148227 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147494 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 1759218631481